@example
             Just before garbage collection

         +------------------------------------+
the-cars |                                    | working
         | mixture of useful data and garbage | memory
the-cdrs |                                    |
         +------------------------------------+
                                            ^
                                            | free

         +------------------------------------+
new-cars |                                    | free   
         |            free memory             | memory
new-cdrs |                                    |
         +------------------------------------+

             Just after garbage collection

         +------------------------------------+
new-cars |                                    | new  
         |          discarded memory          | free  
new-cdrs |                                    | memory
         +------------------------------------+

         +------------------+-----------------+
the-cars |                  |                 | new
         |   useful data    |    free area    | working
the-cdrs |                  |                 | memory
         +------------------+-----------------+
                              ^
                              | free
@end example
@end ifinfo
